<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following South African economic indicators are scheduled for release next week:</p>
<p>DAY    GMT   INDICATOR    PERIOD  FORECAST   RANGE	PREVIOUS</p>
<p>WED    0900  CPI Y/Y	SEPT     8.1 PCT   7.9/8.2    7.5</p>
<p>WED    0900  CPI M/M	SEPT     0.7 PCT   0.5/0.8    0.7</p>
<p>WED+	   TRADE	  SEPT    +0.72 BLN  0.5/1 BLN  +0.13</p>
<p>FRI    1500  MONEY SUPPLY SEPT    15.1 PCT   14.4/15.8  15.51</p>
<p>FRI    1500  PVT CREDIT   SEPT    17.3 PCT   16.8/18.5  17.71</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
